{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "f3936342d75b2eacb616ce67302579580f2ab9fd4322a5e9fb756cb8516355f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nこの衣装のこと、ブログに書いてみましたよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我在部落格写了关于这套服装的文章啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dffc99d889290609bb0c32178f161f89b604c5ddce7b15824f74667c7879e970", "ja": "ああ、俺も読んだよ。\nさっそく、すごい数のコメントが届いてるな！", "zh": "嗯，我有看到。\n马上就有许多人留言了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "c03e624aea414edc7d291f2816bd31f76c9964d6bfa95d732842edf6eaf714fb", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね～。\n子豚ちゃんたちには、おおむね好評だったようです～。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊～\n小猪们大多给予好评呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01fd8dabc89f4b1cff4298d9077ce849f9b7b07eea362eedb5231f60e4575490", "ja": "更新して2秒で書き込みがあったのには、\n少しびっくりしたけど……。", "zh": "不过看到发文完2秒就有人留言，\n我实在有点吓到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "332f65a11645bc8941350f9dd95b4670d1120c4194cc212f27e1f45303033bb7", "ja": "あら、そうですか～？　何にせよ、\n評判になっているようで、よかったです～。", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗～？无论如何，\n大家的评价都很不错，真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "92b419ebdcedf5b9140dae28b8f2ecadae3ae3fb98fd9bc56591389ba69b8f01", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちのコメントには、\n本物の天使に見えた、というものが多かったですね～。", "zh": "很多小猪们都留言说，\n看起来就像真正的天使下凡呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "c2451f49481275933d3defbb6ac881ed3ef30156b15f522489b5dbb0930158ea", "ja": "{$P$}さんのことも、\n今日のところは、ほめてさしあげますよ～。", "zh": "至于{$P$}先生，\n今天我就夸奖你一下吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a88737cef6beb25ab4c3c3526d7ed4407431e150c9b2d04b1c2fc3bf76cda885", "ja": "ありがとう。朋花ファンのみんなが\n満足してくれたみたいで、よかったよ。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n朋花的粉丝们似乎都很满足，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "09450e9669eadb1f0813ffcb71ba57e89a8211076c730f68c4a82e8f2834a91e", "ja": "満足ですか～。確かに今、\n子豚ちゃんたちは満足しているかもしれません～。", "zh": "满足，是吗～？的确，\n小猪们现在是很满足没错～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "4369085048f636f8cd885f90b61eb6ec68645f3b0869dd79608fab402ed40674", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん、\n子豚ちゃんたちは、欲しがりさんなんですよ～？", "zh": "但是{$P$}先生，\n小猪们可是很贪心的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1010_p", "source_sha256": "01e4938eefc7c176210ca011455e74dbcc2f0d4ae984d4d6ce86ef6b3e789605", "ja": "欲しがりさん？", "zh": "贪心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0094_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "d8e71f52921e21f666c98b3989859afb7b092a23bd149056d6748094e6bcb448", "ja": "今は満ち足りていても、刺激には慣れますから……\nすぐに、次を求めるようになってしまうんです～。", "zh": "就算现在满足了，小猪们迟早会感到习惯……\n接着马上就会去追求新的刺激～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
